# Local design prototypes and animation source (not shipped).
# Root-anchored so only the repo-root scratch artefacts match: the motion
# source clips under zt/ are ~69 MB of mp4, and the qn-*.html files are
# throwaway previews. Without this a `git add .` would commit all of it.
/zt/
/qn-*.html

